  "ingredients": [
    "16 ounce chorizo sausage",
    "1 tablespoon butter (for frying)",
    "20 ounce green cabbage",
    "2 tablespoon butter",
    "1 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "2 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "1/2 tablespoon lemon zest",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chorizo-creamed-cabbage/#wprm-recipe-53629-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Keto-Chorizo-Creamed-Cabbage-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a frying pan over medium heat, melt the butter and add fry the chorizo until cooked. Remove from pan and keep warm.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chorizo-creamed-cabbage/#wprm-recipe-53629-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Keto-Chorizo-Creamed-Cabbage-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using a sharp knife, cut the cabbage to shreds.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chorizo-creamed-cabbage/#wprm-recipe-53629-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Keto-Chorizo-Creamed-Cabbage-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the frying pan used for the chorizo, add the shredded cabbage and butter and fry until golden brown. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chorizo-creamed-cabbage/#wprm-recipe-53629-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Keto-Chorizo-Creamed-Cabbage-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add heavy cream to the pan and bring to a boil. Reduce heat to low and let simmer until the cream has thickened.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chorizo-creamed-cabbage/#wprm-recipe-53629-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Keto-Chorizo-Creamed-Cabbage-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add minced garlic and lemon zest, then stir well until combined.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chorizo-creamed-cabbage/#wprm-recipe-53629-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Keto-Chorizo-Creamed-Cabbage-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve the hot chorizo with the creamed cabbage. Add additional salt and pepper if desired.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chorizo-creamed-cabbage/#wprm-recipe-53629-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
